  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Iron Eagle blessed land a Gu Immortal from Liu tribe, Liu Zhuan Shen, smiles toward the sky and asks Nian Er Fu whether Nian Er Ping Zhi is the newest generation Sword Child from Nian Er tribe. Hearing that the lad obtained the Sword Saint true inheritance and was kept ten years, he and other righteous path Gu Immortals change expression mildly while transmitting about Sword Saint Nian Er and the Sword Child title.",
      "chapters": [
        1106
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_iron_eagle_blessed_land",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_liu_tribe",
        "char_nian_er_fu",
        "char_nian_er_ping_zhi",
        "sys_sword_child",
        "fac_nian_er_tribe",
        "inh_sword_saint_true_inheritance",
        "char_sword_saint_nian_er"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Behind Qiao Dong stands Liu tribe’s Gu Immortal Liu Zhuan Shen. With a glance it is obvious Qiao Dong is now under Liu tribe. Liu tribe and Hei tribe have a poor relationship; Qiao Dong, immortalized with Hei tribe support, attacks under Liu Zhuan Shen’s backing after shifting toward Liu tribe as Hei tribe falls.",
      "chapters": [
        1108
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "backing-qiao-dong",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qiao_dong",
        "fac_hei_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He swiftly appears before Qiao Dong under white light that fades darkness, telling Hei Tie Sheng that with him present Qiao Dong cannot be harmed. He is a rank seven Gu Immortal and Hei Tie Sheng’s rival of many years, fought more than a hundred times. Life draining darkness still kills Qiao Dong through the shield. He reads Hei Tie Sheng as prepared to die, retreats when targeted, lures him toward Divine Lord Tian Du and Unfettered Scholar into a three-way clash, and later cannot bring himself to strike the spent Hei Tie Sheng’s final blow.",
      "chapters": [
        1109
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rival-of-hei-tie-sheng",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_tie_sheng",
        "char_divine_lord_tian_du",
        "char_unfettered_scholar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Golden Dawn Hall’s entrance Immortal Wang names him as he walks out. He does not take the stage, instead offering Granny Yin’s corpse to Domination Immortal Chu Du in exchange for Elder Liu Hui’s corpse and soul. After giving Nian Er tribe many benefits for Granny Yin’s body, he puts Chu Du in a spot over coalition morale. Chu Du agrees; both sides exchange corpses, and Liu Zhuan Shen is joyous.",
      "chapters": [
        1197
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "corpse-exchange-with-chu-du",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_golden_dawn_hall",
        "char_immortal_wang",
        "char_granny_yin",
        "char_chu_du",
        "char_liu_hui"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gong Wan Ting tells Chu Du he defeated Liu Zhuan Shen and Yao Yuan Ying consecutively. Liu Zhuan Shen and Yao Yuan Ying have pale expressions; Chu Du is stronger than them.",
      "chapters": [
        1235
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "defeated-by-domination-immortal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gong_wan_ting",
        "char_yao_yuan_ying"
      ]
    }
